&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Employees may be able to purchase company stock (or receive annual bonuses)&lt;br&gt;Employees (and their families) may enroll in the company&#39;s medical, dental, vision, short &amp;amp; long term disability, life insurance, FSA and 401k plans. Employees will also receive 13.34+ hours of paid time off per month, 6 self care days, birthday PTO day, and 10 company paid holidays off per year&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The annual OTE is $117,500 on a 60/40 split.&lt;br&gt;The annual sales commission is uncapped in accordance with the relevant plan documents.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
