&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Development Representative — Mid-Market &amp;amp; Commercial&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;PandaDoc&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PandaDoc is looking for an experienced BDR to join our Mid-Market and Commercial sales team. You&#39;ll work alongside a team of AEs, driving the pipeline primarily through outbound prospecting into 200+ FTE companies, while also converting inbound MQLs when they come in. We expect you to bring your process with you — a proven outbound motion, sharp research habits, and comfort with modern AI tools as part of your daily workflow.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build outbound pipeline through cold calling, email, and video prospecting into 200+ FTE ICP accounts — this is the core of the role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Convert inbound MQLs with speed and precision as a secondary motion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualify prospects and hand off well-researched opportunities to your AE team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Live in Salesforce, Gong Engage, Nooks, Chilipiper, ZoomInfo, and LinkedIn Sales Navigator daily — clean data, no shortcuts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hit a monthly quota of qualified meetings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI tools (including Claude) to research accounts, personalise outreach, and work smarter — not as a shortcut, but as a real competitive edge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1–2 years of BDR/SDR experience at a B2B SaaS company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outbound-first mindset — you&#39;re comfortable building pipeline from scratch, not just working warm leads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience prospecting into mid-market or commercial accounts (200+ FTEs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident on the phone — cold calling is a core part of the daily rhythm here&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of hitting monthly targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication — you write emails that get replies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on with Salesforce CRM and modern sales engagement tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively uses AI tools for research, personalization, and prospecting — familiarity with Claude or similar is a strong plus&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like in 90 Days&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fully ramped on PandaDoc product, ICP, and objection handling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently hitting weekly activity metrics and monthly meeting quota&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First sourced opportunities progressing through the pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A trusted, contributing member of the AE team — not just a meeting-setter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive base salary + uncapped commission&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear BDR → AE promotion track — we promote from within and track it actively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full access to a modern, best-in-class sales stack: Salesforce, Gong Engage, Nooks, Chilipiper, ZoomInfo, LinkedIn Sales Navigator, and Claude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To Apply&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Submit your CV and one paragraph on your outbound approach — what&#39;s your process for breaking into a cold account?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
