&lt;p&gt;Site Reliability Engineers (SREs) are essential to PandaDoc&#39;s success, ensuring customers receive a reliable service with minimal downtime.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The SRE team achieves this by:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning the incident management processes and tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing the observability stack and alerting systems to enable timely investigation and mitigation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively contributing to service codebases to proactively prevent incidents and resolve performance bottlenecks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In essence, SREs are the cornerstone of production service resiliency, driving efforts in observability, incident management, capacity planning, and maintaining reliable operations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
